===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The [[dripping]] of [[rain]] from the [[eaves]] of a house.
# The space around a house on which such water drips.
# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[concealed]] [[aperture]] through which an occupant of a building can [[surreptitiously]] listen to people talking at an entrance to the building.
# {{lb|en|countable}} The act of intentionally hearing a conversation not intended to be heard.
#: {{ux|en|Were you having a little '''eavesdrop''' on us last night?}}

